WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.400
The accountability gap.

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:05.550
How Crown corporations escape scrutiny.

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:09.550
Special examinations occur roughly once per decade.

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:15.337
Between audits, performance, governance, and mandate compliance go unexamined.
